@startuml
' Palette: class; based on the Visual Paradigm guide samples (see README).
skinparam defaultFontColor #111111
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9D9
skinparam NoteBorderColor #555555
hide circle
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
skinparam ClassBorderColor #222222
skinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 40
top to bottom direction

class QuizController <<Java boundary>> {
  +generate(body: QuizRequest): AcceptedQuiz
  +accept(id: UUID, body: AcceptQuizRequest): QuizSummary
  +publish(id: UUID, body: PublishQuizRequest): QuizSummary
}
class QuizRequest <<DTO>> {
  +mode: GenerationMode
  +selectedDocumentIds: UUID[1..10]
  +questionCount: Integer
  +difficulty: Difficulty
  +topic: String?
  +pageRange: PageRange?
  +instructions: String?
}
class QuizService <<Java control>> {
  +create(actorId: UUID, request: QuizRequest): AcceptedQuiz
  +acceptStudent(userId: UUID, id: UUID, request: AcceptQuizRequest): QuizSummary
  +publishTeacher(teacherId: UUID, id: UUID, request: PublishQuizRequest): QuizSummary
}
class QuizGenerationJob <<Java job>> {
  +execute(quizId: UUID, runId: UUID): JobResult
}
class AiClient <<HTTP adapter>> {
  +generate(request: InternalQuizRequest): QuizDraft
}
class QuizGenerator <<Python control>> {
  +generate(scope: AuthorizedScope, constraints: QuizConstraints): QuizDraft
}
class QuizValidator <<Python service>> {
  +validate(draft: QuizDraft, evidence: EvidenceSet): ValidationResult
}
class QuizDraft <<DTO>> {
  +questions: McqSingleQuestion[]
}
class McqSingleQuestion <<DTO>> {
  +options: String[4]
  +correctOptionIndex: Integer
  +explanation: String
  +sources: PageCitation[]
}

QuizController ..> QuizRequest
QuizController --> QuizService
QuizService ..> QuizGenerationJob : enqueue
QuizGenerationJob --> AiClient
AiClient ..> QuizGenerator : internal HTTP
QuizGenerator --> QuizValidator
QuizDraft "1" *-- "1..*" McqSingleQuestion
QuizGenerator ..> QuizDraft

note bottom of QuizService
Student: REVIEW_REQUIRED → READY / REJECTED.
Teacher: REVIEW_REQUIRED → PUBLISHED / REJECTED.
Java sở hữu lifecycle và scoring; Python chỉ trả draft.
end note
@enduml
